# {{.Name}} — runbook

This directory is the **controller** of the `{{.Name}}` cluster. The descriptor is
`{{.Infra}}/{{.File}}`; every member app is a sibling directory of this one.

## Everyday commands

| Goal | Command |
|---|---|
| Build everything and deploy the dev environment | `axon up --build` |
| Preview what a deploy would do | `axon up --build --dry-run` |
| Status, health and front-door URLs | `axon env status dev` |
| Logs of one app | `axon env logs dev <app> --follow` |
| Tear down (keeps data) | `axon down` |
| Validate the descriptor and security posture | `axon cluster check` |
| Full diagnosis of a running environment | `axon env diagnose dev` |
| Run the journey tests | `axon env test dev` |

## Secrets

Secret values live only in `{{.Infra}}/.env` (gitignored) and `{{.Infra}}/secrets/`
(gitignored). Descriptors reference them as `"${NAME}"`. `axon env check dev` lists any
referenced value that is missing.

## Ports

Host ports were allocated free on the machine that ran `axon cluster new`:
{{.Ports.Summary}}. The registry is `~/.config/axon/ports.toml`.
